[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10215.269, "timestamp": "02:50:15", "text": "H 整夜睡得很安稳。怎样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10217.03, "timestamp": "02:50:17", "text": "他们不在吗？等等，它们都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10224.23, "timestamp": "02:50:24", "text": "哦好的。回去工作。我的意思是，不。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10227.429, "timestamp": "02:50:27", "text": "对不起。我们跑题了。但到目前为止，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10230.23, "timestamp": "02:50:30", "text": "我做了这个东西，然后就出来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10231.79, "timestamp": "02:50:31", "text": "边界"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10233.94, "timestamp": "02:50:33", "text": "类似这样的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10235.07, "timestamp": "02:50:35", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10238.51, "timestamp": "02:50:38", "text": "你可能会问，那这个洞呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10242.55, "timestamp": "02:50:42", "text": "呃，我其实不知道。我说就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10245.91, "timestamp": "02:50:45", "text": "暂时就先这样吧。就是这样。为了"}]